# "Then for each Rat you control, create a Wicked Role token attached to that Rat" counts every Rat Bot1 controls, whether a token or a
# card: Bot1's Voracious Vermin (a Rat card, 2/1), the Rat token it made, and the new Rat token = three Roles. The Witch itself is not a
# Rat and gets none. Bot2's own Voracious Vermin and Rat token (cast on turn 2) are not "Rats you control" and stay unenchanted.

